# Example host registry. Copy to registry/hosts, or use `rsync-jobs host add`.
#
# name|role|user|address|port|ssh_opts
#
#   role      both (default), send (source only) or recv (destination only)
#   user      empty lets ~/.ssh/config decide
#   address   empty means the host resolves to plain local paths
#   port      empty lets ~/.ssh/config decide
#   ssh_opts  extra ssh flags, whitespace separated, no spaces inside a value
#
# Comments must be on their own line: '#' is legal inside rsync opts and paths,
# so a trailing comment is never stripped.

nas|both|weezy|nas.lan||
backup|recv|backupsvc|192.168.1.40|2222|-o BatchMode=yes
media|send|piders994|thegoldenunasinn|50314|
